# Profiles you add for yourself in a checkout: a local adapter build, a
# private agent, an experiment. `acp_cockpit/agents/local-*.toml` is loaded
# exactly like the shipped ones and never tracked, so a machine-specific path
# never reaches the repo (an installed copy uses ~/.acp-cockpit/agents/).
acp_cockpit/agents/local-*.toml
